<title>USA: TENNIS-PHILADELPHIA MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PHILADELPHIA MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $714,250</p>
<p>Advanta Championships tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 3-6</p>
<p>7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
